><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250623144334+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250623144336+10'00'" name="90ff916c-3d61-4d65-8ce3-b7a6abecb7d8" page="13" coords="448.664795,349.220154,544.168701,349.220154,448.664795,334.130280,544.168701,334.130280,306.141815,336.720154,544.328857,336.720154,306.141815,321.630280,544.328857,321.630280,306.141815,324.220154,544.443848,324.220154,306.141815,309.130280,544.443848,309.130280,306.141815,311.720154,544.261597,311.720154,306.141815,296.630280,544.261597,296.630280,306.141815,299.220154,544.128052,299.220154,306.141815,284.130280,544.128052,284.130280,306.141815,286.720154,544.356323,286.720154,306.141815,271.630280,544.356323,271.630280,306.141815,274.220154,544.151855,274.220154,306.141815,259.130280,544.151855,259.130280,306.141815,261.720154,544.304260,261.720154,306.141815,246.630280,544.304260,246.630280,306.141815,249.220154,417.771973,249.220154,306.141815,234.130280,417.771973,234.130280" rect="305.670258,233.658722,544.915405,349.691711" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>While there is a lack of&#xD;research on the use of XR in sport, the existing findings&#xD;suggest that XR may be a promising tool for sports training,&#xD;particularly perceptual-cognitive skill training. However, it&#xD;is important to base the design of sport-specific XR tools&#xD;on the key principles of ecological dynamics and RLD, and&#xD;utilise the MPTF to ensure that XR tools are highly representative&#xD;of the real-world performance environment to&#xD;maximise positive transfer.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="13" rect="595.276001,257.220154,779.276001,349.220154"
/></highlight
